  "worked_solution": "Note that $-\\sqrt{81}=-9.$ Therefore $-\\sqrt{81}$ is a negative integer. So it's in the sets $Z,$ ${Z}_{0}^{-},$ and ${Z}^{-}.$ \n\nMoreover, since every integer is also a real number, $-\\sqrt{81}$ also belongs to $R.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, III, and IV.\"",
